{'symbol': 'MTB', 'date': '2022-08-01 09:00:00', 'title': 'M&T BANK NAMES MATTHEW ORRINO MANAGING DIRECTOR AND HEAD OF INSTITUTIONAL COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE CAPITAL MARKETS', 'text': 'ORRINO BRINGS EXTENSIVE EXPERIENCE IN REAL ESTATE CAPITAL MARKETS AND SECURITIZED PRODUCTS TO NEW ROLE WITHIN M&T INVESTMENT BANKING NEW YORK , AUG. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- M&T BANK (NYSE: MTB) ("M&T") ANNOUNCED THAT MATTHEW T. ORRINO HAS BEEN NAMED A MANAGING DIRECTOR AND HEAD OF INSTITUTIONAL COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE (CRE) CAPITAL MARKETS AT M&T INVESTMENT BANKING.'}